---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Learning"
description: "Early Years, Primary, Secondary, Upper Years, and the Global Program at Palm River Academy, side by side."
---

<div class="wrap page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">Learning</p>
  <h1>Five programs, one way of working</h1>
  <p class="lede">Whatever the age, the day has the same shape: academic subjects in English, something physical, something made with your hands. Pick your child's age below.</p>
</div>

<section class="band--paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="programs">
      {% for p in programs %}
      <article class="program program--{{ p.colour }}">
        <p class="program__ages">{{ p.ages }}</p>
        <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.summary }}</p>
        <ul>{% for pt in p.points %}<li>{{ pt }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="{{ p.url | url }}">About {{ p.name }}</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set riverColor = "var(--sand)" %}{% include "partials/river.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Side by side</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Program</th><th>Ages</th><th>Curriculum</th><th>Day</th><th>Class size</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Early Years</td><td>20 months to 4</td><td>British EYFS, in English</td><td>Full or partial day</td><td>Small groups</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Primary</td><td>5 to 11</td><td>Cambridge Primary + vocational</td><td>8:00 to 16:00</td><td>13 or fewer</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Secondary</td><td>11 to 14</td><td>Cambridge Lower Secondary + vocational</td><td>8:00 to 16:00</td><td>13 or fewer</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Upper Years</td><td>14 to 18</td><td>US diploma or Cambridge pathway, exam prep</td><td>8:00 to 16:00</td><td>13 or fewer</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Global Program</td><td>2 to 14</td><td>Joins the above for 3 weeks to 3 months</td><td>Half or full day</td><td>13 or fewer</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="form__note">Exact hours per group are on the <a href="{{ '/families/schedule/' | url }}">daily schedule</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
